# Frontend environment (CRA)

Copy values into a local `.env` or hosting dashboard. Never commit secrets.

```
# Leave empty in local dev — src/setupProxy.js forwards /api → FastAPI (default http://127.0.0.1:8000).
# Set only when the API is on a different public origin (production).
REACT_APP_API_URL=

# Optional override for the dev proxy target
REACT_APP_PROXY_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:8000

# Show "Draft — for review" on Privacy / Terms. Set to false after legal approval.
REACT_APP_SHOW_LEGAL_DRAFT=true
```

## Notes

- Site origin, email and brand paths live in `src/config/site.js` (`SITE_ORIGIN`, `SITE_EMAIL`).
- Analytics keys are bootstrapped in `public/index.html` (PostHog). Deferred loader skips `/admin`. Review keys/host before production.
- Production build: `npm run build` from `frontend/`.
- Admin login requires the backend running; without the proxy, `/api/admin/auth/*` returns CRA 404.
- Blog sitemap: host must rewrite `/blog-sitemap.xml` → API (`frontend/vercel.json.example`).
